                    We are a premium web design agency (
) specializing in building high-converting websites for blue-collar contractors (Roofing, Plumbing, Landscaping, Tree Trimming).We do not do hard-selling over the phone. We build custom, ready-to-launch website mockups for these businesses before we call them. Your sole job is to call the business owner, respect their time, and get permission to text or
 them the private preview link to their mockup.Key Responsibilities:Make 80–100 outbound dials per day using our CRM/Dialer (GoHighLevel).Speak directly with business owners (contractors/tradesmen) using a brief, 30-second script.Update lead statuses accurately in the CRM and log correct mobile numbers/emails.Requirements:.A quiet, professional workspace with zero background noise (no roosters, traffic, or family noise).High-quality USB headset and stable high-speed internet (minimum 25 Mbps download/upload).Thick skin, high energy, and the ability to handle frequent phone rejections naturally.Compensation & Perks:Competitive base hourly pay.Bonus: $2.00 for every qualified mobile number/email collected where the contractor requests the mockup.Bonus: $25.00 for every lead you set that signs a design contract with us.⚠️ APPLICATION REQUIREMENT (DO NOT SKIP):To be considered for this role, you must submit a 30-second audio recording (using Vocaroo or Loom) reading the script below. Applications without an audio sample will be immediately deleted.Script to Record:"Hey Dave, this is Alex with Premium Web Designs. I know you're likely out on a job site right now, so I'll keep this incredibly short. Our design team put together a quick website mockup for your landscaping business to show you how to capture more local quote requests. What’s the best cell number to text that private preview link to so you can look at it later?"
